{"title": "Multiattack: Morphic Ambush", "pageid": 20538, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Morphic_Ambush", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Morphic Ambush</b> is a passive feature of <a href=\"/wiki/Doppelganger\" title=\"Doppelganger\">Doppelgangers</a> that lets them attack multiple times with one <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> if a target is <a href=\"/wiki/Ambushed_(Condition)\" title=\"Ambushed (Condition)\">Ambushed</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Doppelganger)\" title=\"Multiattack (Doppelganger)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Doppelganger)\" title=\"Multiattack (Doppelganger)\">Multiattack</a> if the target is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ambushed_(Condition)\" title=\"Ambushed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ambushed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Ambushed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ambushed_(Condition)\" title=\"Ambushed (Condition)\">Ambushed</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aicir_Tapol\" title=\"Aicir Tapol\">Aicir Tapol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chelvin\" title=\"Chelvin\">Chelvin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Doppelganger\" title=\"Doppelganger\">Doppelganger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edward_Tremby\" title=\"Edward Tremby\">Edward Tremby</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gujj\" title=\"Gujj\">Gujj</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira_(doppelganger)\" title=\"Jaheira (doppelganger)\">Jaheira (doppelganger)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(doppelganger)\" title=\"Koll (doppelganger)\">Koll (doppelganger)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leistine\" title=\"Leistine\">Leistine</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leysin\" title=\"Leysin\">Leysin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ludd\" title=\"Ludd\">Ludd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Olfaith_Olumssdottir\" title=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\">Olfaith Olumssdottir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Podd\" title=\"Podd\">Podd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rigg\" title=\"Rigg\">Rigg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rull\" title=\"Rull\">Rull</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Soxx\" title=\"Soxx\">Soxx</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thonos\" title=\"Thonos\">Thonos</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wobb\" title=\"Wobb\">Wobb</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Woyy\" title=\"Woyy\">Woyy</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715005419\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 943/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5718/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2931/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1135/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 863